    "state": "{\"description\":\"Planned 2026-10-07, build order 3 of 7. F2: relation_candidates weights a shared neighbour by its rarity, as terms already are, so the author and the project count for little, and pools ideas and requirements together when the subject is intent. F3: search_design returns, for each hit, the records directly linked to it by a review relation, EVOLVES_INTO or DECOMPOSES, marked as linked rather than matched. Pinned by the measured case: the one-graph family ranked together.\",\"distinct_from\":[\"fact:root-cause-idea-linking-covers-open-ideas-in-pairs-and-a-vision-spread-across-requirements-is-never-gathered-2026-10-07\"],\"name\":\"Relation suggestions discount ubiquitous neighbours and compare ideas with requirements (F2); search returns each hit's directly linked records (F3)\",\"provenance\":\"authored\",\"status\":\"realized\"}",
